<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-THE NETHERLANDS BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-THE NETHERLANDS BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands beat South Africa 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Giovanni van Bronkhorst 8, Jean-Paul van Gastel 61</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
